The firmly rendered, brisk first movement gave way to melting beauty in the refined slow movement, and was, if anything, even bettered in the scampering, whimsical finale, filled with brilliant passagework and dance-like rhythms. Fialkowska was warmly received but, despite evident efforts on the part of the audience, could not be persuaded to perform and encore. A pity. Perhaps next time.
