"I have leaned in hard, emphatically, repeatedly, over and over again in support of expanding trade, in support of opening up even more of the Mexican and Canadian markets," Sen. Cruz said. "Obviously being right on the border there, the Valley has tremendous economic growth that is coming from trade back and forth across the border.{r} It{g} is{r} something{g} that{r} ought{r} to{r} be{r} an{g} element{r} which{g} is{r} not{r} only{g} important{g} to{r} economic{g} growth{g} but{g} in{g} my{r} opinion{r} a{g} national{g} concern{g} for{r} our{g} country{r} and{r} our{r} people{g}."{r}
